      "line": 303,
      "code": "ace = u32_to_u8 (s + 4, e - s - 4, NULL, &ace_len);",
      "note": "Converts the Unicode codepoints after the 'xn--' ACE prefix to a UTF-8 byte string via u32_to_u8. When the label is exactly 'xn--' with no payload, e - s - 4 == 0 so u32_to_u8 is called with length 0. It returns a heap-allocated buffer (ace) with ace_len == 0, containing no valid bytes."
